            0.881,
            0.122
          ],
          "content": "**Q8. How many lines of symmetry do the shapes in the first shape sequence in Chapter 1, Table 3, the Regular Polygons, have? What number sequence do you get?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.131,
            0.163,
            0.147
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Ans."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.136,
            0.597,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": "| Regular Polygon | No. of line symmetry |\n| --- | --- |\n| Triangle | 3 |\n| Quadrilateral | 4 |\n| Pentagon | 5 |\n| Hexagon | 6 |\n| Heptagon | 7 |\n| Octagon | 8 |\n| Nonagon | 9 |\n| Decagon | 10 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.178,
                0.294,
                0.454,
                0.311
              ],
              "content": "It is a counting number sequence."
            }
          ],
          "image_source": "images/page_39_table_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.32,
            0.882,
            0.357
          ],
          "content": "**Q10. How many lines of symmetry do the shapes in the last shape sequence in Chapter 1, Table 3, the Koch Snowflake sequence, have? How many angles of symmetry?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.366,
            0.521,
            0.383
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Number of lines of symmetry : 3, 6, 6,6,6"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.242,
            0.393,
            0.532,
            0.412
          ],
          "content": "Angles of symmetry : 3, 6, 6,6,6"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.447,
            0.87,
            0.466
          ],
          "content": "**Q11. How many lines of symmetry and angles of symmetry does Ashoka Chakra have?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.475,
            0.478,
            0.52
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Number of lines of symmetry = 24 Number of angles of symmetry = 24"
        },
